# .piiignore — repo-owned PII-scan exclusions (TrueNorth pii-scan, dagger-checks
# v1.1.2+). One path or glob per line, relative to the repo root, '#' comments.
#
# API.md is upstream's generated JSON-RPC API reference: every example carries
# millisecond epoch timestamps, which Presidio's CREDIT_CARD recognizer scores
# 1.0 (Luhn-plausible long digit runs). Eight strict false positives were
# measured on the first full-tree scan (deep-scan run, 2026-11-11). They are
# timestamps, not card numbers. Excluded as a whole file; nothing else is.
# Do NOT add real PII here — rotate it instead.
API.md
